From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:04:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] sync: add incremental SyncYomi v2 for Anikku video libraries

Store video identity and exact playback state in the item-level protocol, verify library ownership before first write, and offer debounced library change sync. Keep native v1 libraries readable by their existing clients. This patch targets Anikku video and seasons.
